{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation-architecture","title":"类型安全导航架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/navigation-architecture","wordCount":480,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型安全导航架构\">类型安全导航架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SwiftUI 的导航经历了三代演进：NavigationView（iOS 13，已废弃）→ NavigationStack/NavigationSplitView（iOS 16）→ SwiftUI 6 的增强型类型安全路由。当前最佳实践是将导航状态建模为枚举路由，配合 <code>NavigationPath</code> 实现程序化跳转、深链接解析和状态恢复。核心设计原则：<strong>导航是状态，不是行为</strong>——页面栈的每一帧都应该是可序列化、可回溯、可测试的数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DeepLink[URL / Push Notification] --&gt; Router&#10;    Router[AppRouter @Observable] --&gt;|append route| NavPath[NavigationPath]&#10;    NavPath --&gt; NavStack[NavigationStack]&#10;    NavStack --&gt;|.navigationDestination| RouteSwitch{Route Enum Switch}&#10;    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageA[ProductList]&#10;    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageB[ProductDetail]&#10;    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageC[Cart]&#10;    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageD[Settings]\">flowchart TD\n    DeepLink[URL / Push Notification] --&gt; Router\n    Router[AppRouter @Observable] --&gt;|append route| NavPath[NavigationPath]\n    NavPath --&gt; NavStack[NavigationStack]\n    NavStack --&gt;|.navigationDestination| RouteSwitch{Route Enum Switch}\n    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageA[ProductList]\n    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageB[ProductDetail]\n    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageC[Cart]\n    RouteSwitch --&gt; PageD[Settings]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>导航方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>状态管理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NavigationStack + Path</td>\n<td>线性栈式导航</td>\n<td><code>NavigationPath</code> 或 <code>[Route]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NavigationSplitView</td>\n<td>iPad/Mac 多栏布局</td>\n<td>sidebar + detail 双绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.sheet</code> / <code>.fullScreenCover</code></td>\n<td>模态弹出</td>\n<td><code>@State</code> / <code>@Presents</code> Bool 或 Optional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TabView</td>\n<td>顶级标签页切换</td>\n<td><code>@State selection</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WindowGroup (visionOS/macOS)</td>\n<td>多窗口</td>\n<td><code>@Environment(\\.openWindow)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路由枚举设计\">路由枚举设计</h2><p>将所有可能的导航目标建模为 <code>Hashable</code> 枚举，每个 case 携带该页面的最小输入参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"enum AppRoute: Hashable {&#10;    case productList&#10;    case productDetail(productId: String)&#10;    case cart&#10;    case checkout&#10;    case orderConfirmation(orderId: String)&#10;    case settings&#10;    case profile(userId: String)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Hashable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> productList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> productDetail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productId: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> checkout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> orderConfirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>枚举的优势：编译器保证 <code>switch</code> 穷尽、新增页面自动要求处理、与 <code>Codable</code> 配合实现状态持久化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"router-模式实现\">Router 模式实现</h2><p>用 <code>@Observable</code> 类封装路由逻辑，与 View 层解耦：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Observable&#10;final class AppRouter {&#10;    var path = NavigationPath()&#10;    var presentedSheet: AppRoute?&#10;    var presentedFullScreen: AppRoute?&#10;&#10;    func navigate(to route: AppRoute) {&#10;        path.append(route)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func pop() {&#10;        guard !path.isEmpty else { return }&#10;        path.removeLast()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func popToRoot() {&#10;        path.removeLast(path.count)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func handleDeepLink(_ url: URL) {&#10;        guard let components = URLComponents(url: url, resolvingAgainstBaseURL: true) else { return }&#10;        switch components.host {&#10;        case &quot;product&quot;:&#10;            let id = components.queryItems?.first { $0.name == &quot;id&quot; }?.value ?? &quot;&quot;&#10;            popToRoot()&#10;            navigate(to: .productList)&#10;            navigate(to: .productDetail(productId: id))&#10;        case &quot;cart&quot;:&#10;            popToRoot()&#10;            navigate(to: .cart)&#10;        default:&#10;            break&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Observable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NavigationPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presentedSheet: AppRoute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presentedFullScreen: AppRoute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> navigate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"